# Generated audit outputs

Run `pnpm --filter workbench exec tsx scripts/runPhase1SlopAudit.ts` with `PROD_DATABASE_URL` set.

Expected files:

- `slop-audit-samples.generated.md` — kept/dropped sample tables per topic
- `../../artifacts/workbench/scripts/AUDIT_LIVE_RELEVANCE.txt` — full relevance audit (from `auditLiveRelevance.ts`)
